    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Itumbulio ja BWANA kwa Habakuki",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nichajoka aighu ya mnara ghwapo nipate kuwona agho BWANA uchaanizera nipate kughora; sena nimanye seji uchaanitumbulia aighu ya malalamiko ghapo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA ukanitumbulia, “Andika iri maza nikuwonyeragha worinyi aighu ya vishawalata va magho, eri uo ushomagha udime kughishoma kwa shwa-shwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa kukaia ngelo ya agho mawono kukatia ndeivikie; ela ngelo yaro iacha. Ikafwana kumuka, kuiweserie; angu loli ichacha ndeichaamuka anduangi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.10.37"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Waeb. 10.37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iji nijo ilagho, ‘Olenyi awo wiko wawiwi rohonyi kwawo, wichalemwa; ela awo wiko na hachi wichakaia moyo angu wiko waloli kwa Mlungu.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.1.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "War. 1.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GAL.3.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wagal. 3.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.10.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Waeb. 10.38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kutanywa kwa awo wiseko na hachi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mali radakalia wandu. Wandu wa choyo wadakukasa nawo ndewina kuhora kungi. Ndewikatwagha jingi weeka sa kifwa. Iyo niyo shekeria wawuyasima kula mbari na kuwidwa wandu wunyika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awandu wasimwa wichawiseka awo wandu na kuwimenya wikighamba, “Ni bugha konyu mmbusagha vilambo viseko venyu. M'bonya huwo hata lii mkiwilawia wasile wenyu?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela imbiri msemanyire, inyo msimie wambenyu mchangia silenyi; nenyo mchalazimishwa kulipa na fwaida raro. Wamaiza wichacha na kukubonya kusughusike. Wichakudwa wunyika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu kusokie mbari nyingi vilambo vawo, awo wisigharikie wichakudwa wunyika; kwa kukaia kwabwaghie wandu wengi na kutotesha masanga mengi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni bugha kwako kuredagha mali ra wuwiwi nyumbenyi kwako na kwa iro kutima kuwika muzi ghwako nicha ghusepato ni mawiwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwaredie waya kwako na kwa nyumba yako; kwabwaghie wandu wa mbari nyingi, kukajitotesha irangi jako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igho jiko wurighenyi ghwa nyumba jichakulilia, na misumbati ya nyumba ichakaia ikidikia icho kililo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni bugha kwako kuaghagha muzi msingi kwa wuwiwi, na kughuagha kwa kubwagha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Welee, ndemmbonagha kukaia maza iri reefuma kwa BWANA Uwadie-Ndighi-Rose; ra wandu kubonya kazi rekorwa, na wandu wa iro mbari kudumika duu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa kukaia ndoenyi kuchachulwa ni kughumanya wubaa ghwa BWANA seji machi ghichuagha baharinyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.11.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa. 11.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni bugha kwako mundu kuwinyoshagha wambenyu chofi nyingi, na kuwiwongera eri kughuzighane wuduu ghwawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na oho wokoni kuchafushwa waya nandighi wulalo ghopata ishima. Kuchanywa hata kutatarike. BWANA uchakubonya kunyo kikombe chako chekabwa, na ishima jako jichaghaluswa jiwuye waya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwademie midi ya msidu ghwa Lebanoni. Oho wokoni kuchademwa. Kwabwaghie nyamandu rerekoghe aho; idana nyamandu richakuobosha oho. Malagho agha ghichabonyeka kwako kwa wundu ghwa kubwagha wandu wengi ndoenyi, na kwa kinyanya chako aighu ya wandu wa mizi yawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlimu ghoko na fwaidaki? Ni kilambo chimu tu chibonyero ni mdamu chisedimagha kukughoria ilagho jingi ela tee nduu. Chabonyeragha fundi waro ilaghoki jiboie eri uchirumirie, mlungu ghusedimagha kudeda! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni bugha kwa uo mundu uzeragha kilambo cha mudi, “Wuka!” Na igho jisededagha, “Wuka kimusi!” Mlimu ghwadima kukufunukuya ilagho jingi? Ghooshingwa dhahabu na feza, ela ndeghuwadie miruke andenyi yake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela BWANA oko andenyi ya Hekalu yake ya wueli; wandu wose wa wurumwengunyi ndewikaie kima imbiri kwake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
